WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.700
Welcome to the Aligned Protocol.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:03.780
We're starting with 10 honest questions

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:06.880
about where your life actually stands right now

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:08.540
We're gonna break it into 10 clear areas

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:10.780
so you can see what's working, what feels off,

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:12.340
so we know where to start.

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:14.400
For each area, give yourself an honest score

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.700
from one to 10.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.340
One means completely out of alignment

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:20.140
and it's not working for you and 10 is fully aligned

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:21.900
and you're living how you want to be.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.500
Use that same scale throughout

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:27.180
and answer based on how things actually feel right now.

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:28.780
There's a space beneath each answer

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:30.060
so you can explain your score.

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:31.860
You can make a few notes about what's working

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:33.180
or what feels difficult,

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:34.860
and it's gonna be useful to come back to

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:36.140
and reflect later on.

